{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"124121","name":"Athens Center Square","description":"Situated in Athens city centre, this attractive and contemporary hotel is within walking distance of many of the city's most celebrated attractions. The famous Parthenon, Odeon of Herodes Atticus, Acropolis Museum, and the Temple of Olympian Zeus can be reached by foot in under 30 minutes, and other nearby attractions include the National Gallery of Art, Museum of Greek Folk Art, and the National Gardens. Rooms are modern and bright, decorated in vivid colours, and feature paintings by Corinna O'Brien, bringing an extra touch of style and grace. Guests can start a busy day of sightseeing with a rich buffet breakfast, and later take a coffee in the chic lobby lounge and enjoy views of the magnificent Acropolis from the rooftop terrace. The hotel also provides free Wi-Fi throughout, and has a helpful tour desk to assist guests in organizing excursions sightseeing in the Athens area.","address":"Aristogeitonos, 15","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"105 52","lat":37.9803461207169,"lng":23.7261714111082,"stars":3,"giataCode":"205389","phone":"+302103222706","email":"acs@athenshotelsgroup.com","website":"www.athenscentersquarehotel.gr","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124121/124121a_hb_a_020.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124121/124121a_hb_a_021.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124121/124121a_hb_a_022.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124121/124121a_hb_a_025.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124121/124121a_hb_a_027.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/12/124121/124121a_hb_a_028.jpg","category":"exterior","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giat